    "https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/3C67A483237F6A324625AB95D568B0C1/jobs/132007": {
      "title": "Market and Ext Affair-Student Assistant",
      "description": "Market and Ext Affair-Student Assistant You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Market and Ext Affair-Student Assistant Springfield, MA 01119 Apply Overview Salary Range $15.00 - $15.00 Hourly Position Type Student Apply Description We are seeking a versatile and creative Marketing Student Assistant to support a wide range of marketing and communications efforts. This role provides hands-on experience across multiple marketing disciplines, including website updates, social media content creation, photo and graphic editing, and general departmental support. The ideal candidate is an adaptable self-starter eager to contribute to the university's broader marketing initiatives. Qualifications Familiarity with websites, basic HTML/CSS, or a strong willingness to learn. Experience with Photoshop or other image editing tools. Interest in digital marketing, data analysis, and user experience. Strong written and verbal communication skills with a keen eye for detail. Ability to work independently and manage time effectively. Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
