      "title": "SAS-Student Assistant 11AM -1PM Monday-Friday(Federal Work Study Only)",
      "description": "SAS-Student Assistant 11AM -1PM Monday-Friday(Federal Work Study Only) You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account SAS-Student Assistant 11AM -1PM Monday-Friday(Federal Work Study Only) Springfield, MA 01119 Quick Apply Overview Salary Range $15.00 - $15.00 Hourly Position Type Student Education Level None Quick Apply Description SAS Office Assistants help the day to day operation of SAS and may: Monitor the \"Front\" of the office as students come and go Proctor, read, or scribe exams as needed Generate Test Return logs Return completed exams Maintain a daily log to document test-related activities, concerns, and priorities Address current or potential problems in a timely manner with input from SAS Specialists Answer and transfer basic phone calls or incoming questions. Provide SAS students with exam accommodations Ensure exam instructions followed Monitor students during exams Contact SAS staff for exam clarification Collect completed exams and return to SAS Assist with Adaptive Technology as needed Convert course material to an accessible format Qualifications Training is available. Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
