      "description": "Adjunct Faculty, Accounting and Finance You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Adjunct Faculty, Accounting and Finance Apply Overview Salary Range $3,100.00 - $5,000.00 Salary Position Type Adjunct Apply Description Western New England University is seeking Adjunct Professor of Accounting and Finance candidates for the Department of Accounting and Finance. Candidates with work experience in accounting and finance – particularly financial reporting – will be considered. Applicants will be expected to teach one course either on-line or in the early evening hours. Subject matter assignment will be aligned with experience or qualifications. Application should include Curriculum Vita, summary of student evaluations (if available) and the names and contact information for three references. Qualifications M.S., M.A., ABD, or Ph. D is required. Professional certification in accounting, CPA or CMA is preferred. Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
