      "title": "Adjunct Instructor Pharmacy Law for Department of Pharmaceutical and Administrative Sciences",
      "description": "Adjunct Instructor Pharmacy Law for Department of Pharmaceutical and Administrative Sciences You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Adjunct Instructor Pharmacy Law for Department of Pharmaceutical and Administrative Sciences Springfield, MA 01119 Apply Overview Salary Range $2,000.00 - $7,000.00 Salary Position Type Adjunct Apply Description The College of Pharmacy and Health Sciences at Western New England University invites applications for an adjunct instructor in the Department of Pharmaceutical and Administrative Sciences to instruct pharmacy law within the pharmacy program for the 2025-2026 academic year. Qualifications Qualified applicants will be a licensed pharmacist, lawyer or have related experience.  Prior experience teaching or in healthcare law is desirable. Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
